实人物的质感"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 151, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "用户提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2310.809326171875, 73.42068481445312], "widgets_values": ["你是一个系统提示词，人物优化方向，8K 超高清，服装模特全身像，真实人类皮肤质感，自然毛孔纹理（直径 0.1-0.3mm），皮下毛细血管隐约可见，轻微泛红的鼻翼与颧骨，眼角细微干纹，嘴唇自然唇纹与淡淡唇色，皮肤油脂光泽（T 区轻微反光，脸颊哑光），自然光 / 棚拍柔光照射，皮肤通透感，汗毛细腻可见（长度 0.5-1mm），无过度磨皮，保留皮肤自然瑕疵（如极淡痘印、细小雀斑），服装质感清晰（可替换为具体服装类型：西装 / 连衣裙 / 运动装），表情自然放松，背景简洁（纯色背景 / 简约工作室背景），光影过渡柔和，超写实细节拉满"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 152, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "系统提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [325.4485168457031, 386.96234130859375], "pos": [-624.5858764648438, 492.3429870605469], "widgets_values": ["A hyper-realistic full-body studio portrait of a striking young Asian woman with an intense, icy cold expression, exuding an aura of aloof sophistication. She has long, sleek, jet-black hair that cascades down her back, caught in a gentle, artificial breeze that lifts strands dynamically around her face. Her skin is porcelain-smooth with a subtle, dewy texture, and her makeup is minimal but sharp, featuring defined eyeliner and muted rose lips. She is dressed in a fitted, heather-grey long-sleeved ribbed top that hugs her silhouette, the fabric showing realistic cotton texture and subtle wrinkles around the waist and elbows, paired with short black fitted shorts that reveal her toned legs. Her pose is confident and slightly guarded, hands resting near her hips, fingers gently touching her thighs. The background is a seamless, infinite pure white studio cyclorama, eliminating all distractions and focusing entirely on the subject. The lighting is high-key fashion photography style, with a large softbox providing even, flattering illumination from the front, and subtle rim lighting to separate her dark hair from the background. Shot on a Phase One XF IQ4 150MP Camera system with an 85mm portrait lens, f/8 aperture for razor-sharp focus from head to toe, capturing every strand of hair and weave of fabric in 8k resolution, commercial fashion editorial aesthetic."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 262, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 157, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [263], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [604.8551025390625, 1360.131103515625], "pos": [-1314.6876220703125, 509.8191223144531], "widgets_values": ["8878354c6bb89d07bfe2caf5bda5e97aa0cc790d003fd684051a72f7ced230b9.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 158, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [262, 265], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [473.9586486816406, 584.6121215820312], "pos": [-684.9778442382812, 938.5269165039062], "widgets_value